# The file_marshal package's manifest (format: packages/README.md).
package file_marshal
version 0.1.1
summary one owner in front of the files under a root, reached through port_marshal as "files": edits given by their context (with the nearest candidate for an edit that knows its place), writes if a version, appends, a durable history with undo and revert, and the shifts each edit makes so positions can be carried past it (docs/plans/file-marshal.md, steps 1 to 3)
entry service.patlang
depends port_marshal >= 0.1.0, < 0.2.0
include edits.patlang
include history.patlang
include service.patlang
